    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the racing, pari-mutuel wagering and breeding law, in relation\nto prohibiting regional off-track betting corporations from providing items of\nvalue exceeding fifteen dollars to certain associates of the corporation",
    "basePrintNo": "S7856",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S7856-2021",
